  "notes": [
    "Irregular yo present: *envejezco* (c→zc before *a/o*); same pattern as *conocer*, *parecer*, *crecer*",
    "Subjuntivo stem from yo form: *envejezc-*",
    "Past participle: *envejecido*",
    "Can be intransitive (*Envejece bien* — He's ageing well) or transitive (*El estrés te envejece* — Stress ages you)",
    "*envejecer bien/mal* = to age well/badly",
    "Related: *viejo/a* = old; *la vejez* = old age; *el envejecimiento* = ageing"
  ],
